      "compound_name": "[Mn10Dy6(R-L1)6(L2)2(μ5-O)(μ4-O)6(μ3-OH)6(μ2-OH)2(Ac)12][Mn6Dy2(R-L1)6(L2)2(μ4-O)2(μ3-OH)2(Ac)2(H2O)2]·4ClO4·10H2O·EtOH",
      "formula": "C208H278Cl4Mn16N12O115Dy8",
      "ccdc_numbers": [
